[*]Device trees: [URL=https://github.com/Evolution-X-Devices/device_google_pantah/tree/cnb]Evolution-X-Devices/device_google_pantah (cnb)[/URL], [URL=https://github.com/Evolution-X-Devices/device_google_gs201/tree/cnb]device_google_gs201 (cnb)[/URL]
[*]Kernel: built by LineageOS's build_kernel from [URL=https://github.com/LineageOS/android_kernel_google_gs201_manifest]LineageOS's gs201 kernel manifest[/URL]
